WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.067
♪♪

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:04.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.634
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:07.534
Happy New Year, everyone!

00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:10.300
Tonight is our first show
of 2023.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.868
It was going to be yesterday,
but I was on Southwest, so.

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:15.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:18.400
The House held its vote today
to elect a new speaker

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.334
and went to multiple ballots
for the first time in 100 years.

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:24.334
It's the moment every member
of Congress fears --

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.234
having to work longer hours.

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:27.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:29.667
President Biden is set tomorrow
to promote

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:32.834
the bipartisan infrastructure
bill at an event in Kentucky

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:34.567
with Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.501
That's right, America's
crumbling infrastructure

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:41.133
is going to promote the
bipartisan infrastructure bill.

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:43.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:45.367
The CDC is warning
that a new variant

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:47.334
of the Omicron strain
of coronavirus

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:49.334
has nearly doubled
over the past week,

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:51.601
so it looks like COVID
is the only thing

00:00:51.601 --> 00:00:54.534
that's actually doing
new year, new me.

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:57.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.701 --> 00:01:00.534
Republicans took control today
of the House of Representatives

00:01:00.534 --> 00:01:02.067
for the first time
in four years.

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:04.901
Well, the first
legal time in four years.

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:07.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.534
George Santos was sworn in today
as a member

00:01:09.534 --> 00:01:11.667
of the House of Representatives
in the state of New York

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:13.667
and, not as he
originally claimed,

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:14.734
Pandora.

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:16.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:19.501
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:01:19.501 --> 00:01:20.601
We had a moment backstage.

00:01:20.601 --> 00:01:21.734
We were like,
"Do we think everybody's

00:01:21.734 --> 00:01:23.400
up to speed on the
George Santos story?"

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:26.868
Been two weeks.
Everybody's with family.

00:01:26.868 --> 00:01:29.734
They're not going to be reading
the news every day.

00:01:29.734 --> 00:01:30.767
And now we know.

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:32.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.934
Did you guys know "Avatar"
came out?

00:01:33.934 --> 00:01:37.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:39.667
Former President Trump
was reportedly DJing

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:41.934
on his iPad
at Mar-A-Lago last week...

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:43.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.234 --> 00:01:45.968
...and played Celine Dion's
"My Heart Will Go On."

00:01:45.968 --> 00:01:48.200
[ Laughter ]
Wow, the guy definitely knows

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.634
how to get a party started.

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:50.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:51.767
What'd he play at midnight,

00:01:51.767 --> 00:01:53.934
"Everybody Hurts" by R.E.M.?

00:01:53.934 --> 00:01:55.067
[ Laughter ]
[ As Trump ] Of course,

00:01:55.067 --> 00:01:56.868
no one hurts more than I do.

00:01:56.868 --> 00:01:59.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.067 --> 00:02:00.968
That's right,
Trump was DJing on his iPad

00:02:00.968 --> 00:02:02.400
last week at Mar-A-Lago

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:05.133
and I think the legal bills
are piling up for him

00:02:05.133 --> 00:02:08.133
because every song was followed
by a Spotify ad.

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:10.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.901 --> 00:02:12.234
[ As Trump ]
Just a few quick words

00:02:12.234 --> 00:02:13.567
from my friends at Spotify.

00:02:13.567 --> 00:02:15.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:17.400
According
to newly released testimony,

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.567
former First Lady Melania Trump
was upset

00:02:19.567 --> 00:02:23.400
that Rudy Giuliani was allowed
inside the White House residence

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:26.200
and was worried about him seeing
her wearing a bathrobe.

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.934
Or, 1,000 times more likely,

00:02:29.934 --> 00:02:31.467
her seeing him in one.

00:02:31.467 --> 00:02:34.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.033 --> 00:02:37.067
New York state's first licensed
marijuana store opened last week

00:02:37.067 --> 00:02:38.834
in Manhattan at 4:20 p.m.,

00:02:38.834 --> 00:02:40.601
and it must be good weed

00:02:40.601 --> 00:02:43.334
because it was supposed to open
at 10:00 a.m.

00:02:43.334 --> 00:02:45.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.634 --> 00:02:46.901
And finally, yesterday was

00:02:46.901 --> 00:02:49.934
National 55 Mile Per Hour
Speed Limit Day,

00:02:49.934 --> 00:02:51.767
or, as it's called
in New Jersey,

00:02:51.767 --> 00:02:53.300
the texting lane.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:58.133
House Republican leader
Kevin McCarthy failed to secure

00:02:58.133 --> 00:03:00.701
enough votes to ascend
to the Speakership today

00:03:00.701 --> 00:03:02.200
after a fifth ballot.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.200
Incidentally, a fifth is also

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.033
what he drank during the vote.

00:03:06.033 --> 00:03:07.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.767
"Son of a gun."

00:03:08.767 --> 00:03:10.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.467
20 House Republicans voted

00:03:11.467 --> 00:03:13.434
against GOP leader
Kevin McCarthy

00:03:13.434 --> 00:03:15.100
during today's fifth
Speaker ballot.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.934
God, you guys can't even have

00:03:16.934 --> 00:03:19.434
a red wave amongst yourselves.

00:03:19.434 --> 00:03:20.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:23.100
The White House said yesterday
that President Biden has

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:26.067
no plans to intervene
in the House Speaker election

00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:28.567
after Republican Kevin McCarthy
failed to secure enough votes

00:03:28.567 --> 00:03:31.400
during the second ballot
to ascend to the Speakership,

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:34.400
at least not until it stops
being hilarious.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.067
During his inaugural address
yesterday,

00:03:38.067 --> 00:03:40.901
Florida governor Ron DeSantis
criticized Democrats' agenda

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:44.400
and said, quote, "Florida
is where woke goes to die."

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.868
In fact,

00:03:45.868 --> 00:03:48.200
it's where
everything goes to die.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:50.033 --> 00:03:51.701
So, to be fair.

00:03:51.701 --> 00:03:54.434
According to newly released
Congressional testimony,

00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:56.834
ex-White House adviser
Kellyanne Conway said

00:03:56.834 --> 00:03:59.167
that former President Trump
is afraid

00:03:59.167 --> 00:04:01.234
of former First Lady
Melania Trump.

00:04:01.234 --> 00:04:03.501
Well, she is an immigrant.

00:04:03.501 --> 00:04:04.501
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.501 --> 00:04:06.133
Disgraced...

00:04:07.834 --> 00:04:10.133
Disgraced cryptocurrency
exchange founder

00:04:10.133 --> 00:04:12.901
Sam Bankman-Fried pleaded
not guilty yesterday

00:04:12.901 --> 00:04:15.367
in federal court
on a series of charges

00:04:15.367 --> 00:04:16.701
including money laundering,

00:04:16.701 --> 00:04:18.367
which from the looks of him

00:04:18.367 --> 00:04:21.033
may be the only thing
he's ever laundered.

00:04:21.033 --> 00:04:22.734
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.734 --> 00:04:24.734
The Southwest Airlines
pilot union

00:04:24.734 --> 00:04:26.234
published a letter yesterday

00:04:26.234 --> 00:04:28.567
denouncing the carrier's
leadership and said

00:04:28.567 --> 00:04:30.901
the company was turning
into a cult.

00:04:30.901 --> 00:04:32.601
Even worse, they only give you

00:04:32.601 --> 00:04:34.434
half a Kool-Aid.

00:04:34.434 --> 00:04:36.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:45.300
Anytime you can make a joke
both about how small

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.634
the beverage servings are
on airlines

00:04:47.634 --> 00:04:49.634
and Jonestown...

00:04:49.634 --> 00:04:52.934
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.934 --> 00:04:55.601
...comedy gold.

00:04:55.601 --> 00:04:57.100
A woman in West Virginia

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.100
recently had her wallet
returned to her

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:03.834
nearly 55 years after she
lost it at a high school dance.

00:05:03.834 --> 00:05:05.334
"That's not all she lost,"

00:05:05.334 --> 00:05:07.667
said her 54-year-old daughter.

00:05:07.667 --> 00:05:09.701
[ Laughter ]

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.167
You guys did the math
very quickly.

00:05:18.167 --> 00:05:19.501
[ Laughter ]

00:05:19.501 --> 00:05:22.167
The makers of International
Delight coffee creamer

00:05:22.167 --> 00:05:24.167
have announced they will release
a new flavor

00:05:24.167 --> 00:05:27.167
inspired by the Central Perk
coffee shop on "Friends."

00:05:27.167 --> 00:05:30.501
Although, I don't know
if you can call vanilla "new."

00:05:30.501 --> 00:05:32.467
[ Laughter ]

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:36.667
Two people in Florida
were arrested recently

00:05:36.667 --> 00:05:39.167
after one of them allegedly
called 911

00:05:39.167 --> 00:05:40.667
to get help moving items

00:05:40.667 --> 00:05:43.133
from a home
they were burglarizing.

00:05:43.133 --> 00:05:45.467
But to be fair,
the police did help.

00:05:45.467 --> 00:05:47.801
[ Laughter ]

00:05:47.801 --> 00:05:51.133
It's a jail cell.

00:05:51.133 --> 00:05:54.133
When you put too much
nice furniture in a jail cell,

00:05:54.133 --> 00:05:57.467
it just looks like a studio
apartment in New York City.

00:05:57.467 --> 00:05:59.133
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.133 --> 00:06:01.534
Like, everybody saw that,
they were like, "Well, ehhh..."

00:06:01.534 --> 00:06:02.934
[ Laughter ]

00:06:02.934 --> 00:06:04.934
"You say I get
three meals a day?"

00:06:04.934 --> 00:06:06.100
[ Laughter ]

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.467
And finally, a man in Idaho

00:06:07.467 --> 00:06:09.133
recently set
a Guinness World Record

00:06:09.133 --> 00:06:13.801
after stomping 100 balloons
in 22.38 seconds.

00:06:13.801 --> 00:06:16.801
It was for Most Ruined
Birthday Party.

00:06:16.801 --> 00:06:19.167
[ Laughter ]

00:06:19.167 --> 00:06:22.467
President Biden said yesterday
that he will travel next week

00:06:22.467 --> 00:06:23.601
to the southern border

00:06:23.601 --> 00:06:25.300
for the first time
since taking office.

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:28.801
When asked if it was dangerous,
the Secret Service said,

00:06:28.801 --> 00:06:31.801
"A little, but we don't think
he'll actually try to escape."

00:06:31.801 --> 00:06:35.701
[ Laughter ]

00:06:35.701 --> 00:06:37.734
The House of Representatives
adjourned last night

00:06:37.734 --> 00:06:40.200
after a sixth round of voting
for House Speaker

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.267
and reconvened today at noon.

00:06:42.267 --> 00:06:44.400
Because nothing says
"we're working hard

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:47.667
to solve this problem"
like starting at noon.

00:06:47.667 --> 00:06:49.968
[ Laughter ]

00:06:49.968 --> 00:06:51.400
Former President Trump
reportedly called

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:53.834
House Republican leader
Kevin McCarthy on Monday night

00:06:53.834 --> 00:06:55.334
ahead of the Speaker vote

00:06:55.334 --> 00:06:59.234
and urged him to accept all
of the Freedom Caucus's demands.

00:06:59.234 --> 00:07:01.400
But unfortunately
McCarthy told him

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.300
hair gel in the water fountains
wasn't feasible.

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:06.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:06.667 --> 00:07:09.567
Goldman Sachs this week
ended its free coffee perk

00:07:09.567 --> 00:07:11.100
for employees, which is weird,

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:14.367
because there are still
piles of sugar on the desks?

00:07:14.367 --> 00:07:16.601
[ Audience ohs, laughs ]

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:24.167
A federal appeals court ruled --
[ Light laughter ]

00:07:24.167 --> 00:07:26.267
A federal appeals court
ruled last week

00:07:26.267 --> 00:07:27.934
that a teacher
in Washington State

00:07:27.934 --> 00:07:29.667
who wore a MAGA hat to school

00:07:29.667 --> 00:07:31.267
was protected
by the 1st Amendment.

00:07:31.267 --> 00:07:33.434
"Cool,"
said one of his students.

00:07:33.434 --> 00:07:36.767
[ Laughter ]

00:07:36.767 --> 00:07:40.133
According to a new report,
nearly half of American workers

00:07:40.133 --> 00:07:43.067
are planning to look for a
new job in the next six months.

00:07:43.067 --> 00:07:45.901
And some will still be looking
for the same one.

00:07:45.901 --> 00:07:48.701
[ Laughter ]

00:07:48.701 --> 00:07:50.934
The "New York Post"
recently launched a contest

00:07:50.934 --> 00:07:53.767
for high school students to win
a chance to publish an article,

00:07:53.767 --> 00:07:55.067
and it was a reminder...

00:07:55.067 --> 00:07:58.400
you cannot trust Hannah R.
with anything.

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:00.634
[ Laughter ]

00:08:03.834 --> 00:08:07.133
A baby gear start-up company
this week unveiled

00:08:07.133 --> 00:08:10.267
a $3,300 self-driving stroller.

00:08:10.267 --> 00:08:13.601
Previously, all the self-driving
strollers on the market

00:08:13.601 --> 00:08:15.334
only worked on hills.

00:08:15.334 --> 00:08:18.634
[ Laughter ]

00:08:21.667 --> 00:08:24.067
Mechan--
[ Laughs ]

00:08:24.067 --> 00:08:26.267
Mechanics at
a Florida car dealership

00:08:26.267 --> 00:08:29.167
recently found a rabbit
trapped in the vehicle's motor

00:08:29.167 --> 00:08:30.667
while doing an oil change.

00:08:30.667 --> 00:08:34.167
Said the mechanic, "So, that's
gonna be at least another $750,

00:08:34.167 --> 00:08:36.501
and I can't even
get another rabbit here

00:08:36.501 --> 00:08:37.734
until late next week."

00:08:37.734 --> 00:08:43.033
[ Laughter ]

00:08:43.033 --> 00:08:45.534
Today was
National Screenwriters Day.

00:08:45.534 --> 00:08:47.901
They spent it --
interior -- Starbucks --

00:08:47.901 --> 00:08:49.033
pretending to work.

00:08:49.033 --> 00:08:53.467
[ Laughter ]

00:08:53.467 --> 00:08:56.534
And finally, today was also
National Bird Day.

00:08:56.534 --> 00:08:58.267
Or, as they call it
in New Jersey,

00:08:58.267 --> 00:08:59.300
a turn signal.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:01.234
You guys...
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:01.234 --> 00:09:02.501
...that was the monologue.

00:09:02.501 --> 00:09:06.968
♪♪

